    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「えっとね、あんずさんに渡されたの合い鍵！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「勘違いしないでねっ、あんずさんに頼まれたの！　だから、わたし……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（お、落ち着いて、わたし！　挙動不審すぎる、深呼吸～！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（でもでも、緊張する～！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あ、あれ？　転校生くん、寝てるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（部屋に灯りが点いてないし、でもベッドの掛け布団はふくらんでるし……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（やっぱり、熟睡ちゅう？　だから、呼び鈴にも反応してくれなかったんだね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
